# Architektura

## Struktura folderów (wymuszona)

```
src/
  app/              # expo-router — tylko routing i kompozycja ekranów
  components/       # prezentacyjne (memo), podfoldery: cycle/, common/, ui/
  contexts/         # AuthContext, CycleContext, QuoteContext
  hooks/            # useAuth, useCycles, useDailyQuote, useNetwork
  services/         # firebase/, zenquotes/, notifications/
  lib/cycle/        # PURE functions — kalkulacje cyklu
  lib/storage/      # AsyncStorage, SecureStore wrappers
  types/            # Cycle, User, Quote
  constants/        # theme.ts, paperTheme.ts
```

## Context API + useReducer

Globalny stan **tylko** w Contextach. Lokalny UI (`modalOpen`, `inputValue`) → `useState`.

```typescript
// src/contexts/cycle-context.tsx — wzorzec
type CycleState = { cycles: Cycle[]; isLoading: boolean; error: string | null };
type CycleAction =
  | { type: 'FETCH_START' }
  | { type: 'FETCH_SUCCESS'; payload: Cycle[] }
  | { type: 'FETCH_ERROR'; payload: string }
  | { type: 'ADD_CYCLE'; payload: Cycle }
  | { type: 'REMOVE_CYCLE'; payload: string };

function cycleReducer(state: CycleState, action: CycleAction): CycleState {
  switch (action.type) {
    case 'FETCH_START': return { ...state, isLoading: true, error: null };
    case 'FETCH_SUCCESS': return { cycles: action.payload, isLoading: false, error: null };
    // ...
  }
}
```

Eksportuj: `CycleProvider`, `useCycles()` — hook rzuca błąd poza Providerem.

## Separacja warstw

| Warstwa | Odpowiedzialność | Przykład |
|---------|------------------|----------|
| `app/*.tsx` | Routing, layout, kompozycja | `(tabs)/index.tsx` łączy hooki + komponenty |
| `components/` | Render UI, props in / events out | `<CycleListItem cycle={} onPress={} />` |
| `contexts/` | Stan globalny, orchestracja | `addCycle()` → service → reducer → haptics |
| `services/` | IO: Firebase, API, notifications | `fetchCycles(uid)` |
| `lib/cycle/` | Logika czysta, bez React/Firebase | `calculateAverageCycleLength()` |

## Naming

- Pliki: `kebab-case.tsx` (`cycle-list-item.tsx`)
- Komponenty: `PascalCase` (`CycleListItem`)
- Hooki: `use` prefix (`useCycles`)
- Typy: `PascalCase` w `src/types/cycle.ts`
- Stałe: `SCREAMING_SNAKE` lub obiekty `as const` w `constants/`

## Importy

Używaj aliasu `@/` (zdefiniowany w `tsconfig.json`):

```typescript
import { useCycles } from '@/hooks/use-cycles';
import { calculateAverageCycleLength } from '@/lib/cycle/calculations';
```

## Zakaz logiki domenowej w komponentach

```typescript
// ❌ BAD — w komponencie
const avg = dates.reduce((a, b) => a + b) / dates.length;

// ✅ GOOD
import { calculateAverageCycleLength } from '@/lib/cycle/calculations';
const avg = calculateAverageCycleLength(cycles.map(c => new Date(c.startDate)));
```
